# DESK42 -- the rebuilt ADDISKIN box on the C: drive icon.
#
#   B_CSEL      the C: drive icon selected
#   C_DISKINFO  the ADDISKIN box: DISK INFORMATION / Drive identifier /
#               Disk label / Number of folders / Number of files /
#               Bytes used / Bytes available, OK + Cancel
#   D_DISKOK    after OK -- the box is gone and the desktop is intact
